/-!
# KFT §0: a counted repetition with a literal count

`rpt A C D n b`: push the literal `n` on `A`, turn it into `n` marks on `C` (KFC `pro`, linear
`cUL n`), run `b` once per mark (`uloop`, `64` per iteration), clean up (`epi`) and drop `n`.
`rpt_runs`: if `b` takes `T k` to `T (k+1)` whatever `A, C, D` hold, then `rpt` takes `T 0` to
`T n` at cost `n (c + 64) + cRpt n`, `cRpt n = O(n + 1)`.
-/

